      "q": "Who are the largest federal contractors in Wisconsin?",
      "a": "OPTUMSERVE HEALTH SERVICES, INC. is the largest federal contractor in Wisconsin with $85.6M in obligations. WISCONSIN PHYSICIANS SERVICE INSURANCE CORP. is the second-largest with $41.8M. Other top vendors include GE PRECISION HEALTHCARE LLC and FLEXION INC at $7.8M each, and U.S. VET GENERAL CONTRACTING, LLC at $5.8M."
